### Variables
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1.1/commerce
@username = testuser
@password = password123

### 1. Authenticate & Obtain Token
# @name login
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1.1/token/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "{{username}}",
    "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Store access token from response
@authToken = {{login.response.body.access}}

### 2. Fetch Product List
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 3. Create Order with Item (Product ID: 1)
# @name createOrder
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/create_order_with_item/1/
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "quantity": 2
}

### Store created order ID from response
@orderId = {{createOrder.response.body.id}}

### 4. Add Another Item to Existing Order (Product ID: 2)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/add_item/2/
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "quantity": 1
}

### 5. Initiate Order Payment
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/pay/
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 6. Simulate Payment Callback (Redirect URL)
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments/callback/{{orderId}}?status=successful&tx_ref=TX_MOCK_12345

### 7. Simulate Payment Webhook (Gateway Postback)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/webhook/
Content-Type: application/json
verif-hash: mock_secret_hash

{
    "event": "charge.completed",
    "data": {
        "status": "successful",
        "tx_ref": "order_{{orderId}}",
        "amount": 5000
    }
}

### 8. Verify Order Details After Payment
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
